description:
The Authority is undertaking preliminary market engagement in relation to the potential future supply and through-life support of Fixed and Portable Atmosphere Monitoring Systems (AMS) and associated equipment and services.
The potential requirement may include, but is not limited to:
- supply of AMS equipment, approved replacements, spares, consumables, accessories and associated support equipment;
- inspection, maintenance, calibration, survey, repair and refurbishment of in-scope equipment;
